        552.1726684570312,
        222.26731872558594,
        566.0304565429688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "k = 0. The exponent term satisfies that αk ∈R, and 0 < α0 < α1 < ⋯<",
      "bbox": [
        217.55999755859375,
